{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "3155084ddf2ee11014c540aae29934feb1490c4813fcfd34bcdc07f88a92ff6f", "ja": "14歳の観光大使", "zh": "14岁的观光大使", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6f4f34f63f609514b2d246df1d898d8cb90537b99581edc4ea92aec5b9d536d5", "ja": "観光大使の仕事で地方に行くことになった\nやよいと同行する可奈。二人だけでもしっか\nり仕事をこなすものの、地元の方からたくさ\nんのお土産をもらうばかりでお返しを用意し\nていない自分達の甘さに落胆する。", "zh": "由于观光大使的工作，弥生前往地方出差，可奈随行同行。两人独自一人也顺利完成了工作，然而收到了许多当地人的土特产，却没有准备回礼，两人对自己欠考虑的一面感到沮丧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e4dea86c407e2a44a2f147bbc7e954745b7a834789f7db22e68906baee2f32c4", "ja": "（今日はやよいに特別な仕事が入っている。\n一日仕事となるが、頑張ってもらおう！）", "zh": "（今天弥生有一份特别的工作。\n虽然要忙一整天，但希望她能加油！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "81b5cc16f6c2eaf572af6720a0aae2a90181c3e2e00b5082a50de453bdc3fc1d", "ja": "高槻やよい！\n観光大使のお仕事、がんばります！！", "zh": "高槻弥生！我会努力做好旅游大使的工作！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "9e739b734c2cdf3af42c8cf40001e1522e25aff6aa24203115a6a32b721e6f36", "ja": "おめでとう、やよいちゃん！\n私も頑張ってサポートするからね！", "zh": "恭喜你，弥生！\n我也会努力支持你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d240bb9036ab3d4acd1a956a771f2899146860f695ccbc316abbed36cf849018", "ja": "でも、本当に二人だけで大丈夫か？\nちゃんと同行する予定だったんだけど……。", "zh": "不过，真的只靠你们两个没问题吗？我本来打算陪你们一起去的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "5a9d9e262a9065b2de4966b303618868d6d37c38c73cc26eeb58a12213ffb587", "ja": "大丈夫です！　私たち大人を目指してるんですから、\nお仕事も自分たちだけで頑張らなくちゃ！", "zh": "没问题的！因为我们可是以成为大人为目标的，\n所以工作也得全靠我们自己去努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "0fa39993241c7fadfbd0a6ed76b1c275d46d893bb74f9421af8de7f9f44d6442", "ja": "ひとりだとドキドキしちゃいますけど、\n可奈ちゃんも一緒だから平気かなーって。", "zh": "一个人的话会紧张，不过可奈也一起去，所以应该没问题吧——我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "ed93791747c1868349f4f52cbf58499b2b2a77e0cbcb79f00eff98576e601131", "ja": "ねー！", "zh": "就是说嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "ed93791747c1868349f4f52cbf58499b2b2a77e0cbcb79f00eff98576e601131", "ja": "ねー！", "zh": "就是说嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "5db3b9d0d9c8c6f8ef53784489c2b311995ed25dcefeec4b3897cbe3b4d63237", "ja": "私もいっぱい勉強して、街の名産品も観光地も、\nばっちり頭に入ってるんですよ！", "zh": "我也好好学习了一番，街上的特产和旅游景点，我全都牢牢记住了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "da4a32b4b6b22aa49e93102dae87a88632b876b2c5f737aaa052bc060270c74f", "ja": "高槻やよいは観光大使～♪\nきっとなにかの、ご縁だね～♪", "zh": "高槻弥生是观光大使～♪\n一定是某种缘分吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4bc98032956b497aeb7fa64271bdbb6815ac975d0ab33c44f9f78c2d84848f90", "ja": "まあ、二人だけで行くというのも確かに経験だ。\nそれじゃ今回は任せるから、気を付けて行くんだぞ！", "zh": "好吧，就你们两个人去也确实算是一种历练。\n那这次就交给你们了，路上注意安全啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "bfba352c784d0fa60330c129772a8e3f79cbd7619af0d089097b4f5f2e315cb2", "ja": "はい！\nそれじゃあ、いってきまーす！", "zh": "好的！\n那么，我们出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "772538e8c9d1abe99841134679c4e9fcdab0404d916d43fc45e565aafed8bda7", "ja": "お土産、楽しみにしててくださいねー！", "zh": "请期待我带回来的纪念品哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "444d90facb7fef365bf2f331712d52e3bb5217962fdcae033c1819a33767a61a", "ja": "（……さて、新幹線の予約サイトを開いて、と。\n席は隣の号車がいいかな……）", "zh": "（……好了，打开新干线的预约网站。座位选在相邻的车厢比较好吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1015_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "bf195137fa380bfd4f4eeb7a9937e4f28de3e975936bcd93411d1bb5a980bcb2", "ja": "ようこそお越しくださいました。\n高槻やよいさん、矢吹可奈さん。", "zh": "欢迎光临。\n高槻弥生先生、矢吹可奈小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1016_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "d4a194eb55eec63f4b0004e895ae3c887bff37efc9735c58f15bee809c1ce3f9", "ja": "今日はこの公園で行われるステージイベントに\nご出演いただく予定です。場所はここから……。", "zh": "今天预定要在这个公园举行的舞台活动中登台演出。地点从这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "2a946c096c1317589e7ea53c0988cf4246eff7676bf6efb63129c961f463ad9c", "ja": "あ、古墳のところですよね！\nす～っごく広くてきれいなところだなーって。", "zh": "啊，是在古坟那边对吧！\n那里特别宽敞又漂亮，我一直觉得是个很棒的地方呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "3625ce9b7816ae1af0b3800ad91d8949cbb1978326165551d2cccdcc1715093c", "ja": "私もネットで見て、歌ったらとっても\n気持ちよさそう～とか思ってました♪", "zh": "我也在网上看过，想着要是在那里唱歌，一定会感觉特别舒服吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1019_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "660d9c96a8dd762095a2928e65bd59557b7ed929286d32fa4593ae7b1c4da600", "ja": "おお、ありがとうございます！\n他にも召し上がってほしい名産品もたくさん……。", "zh": "哦哦，谢谢您！\n还有很多想让您品尝的特产……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e36051d73aa76aed1e53e4ea5f380d51b7764741fc42e5107a9b9bf74c64cf9", "ja": "寒天が有名なんですよね！\nヘルシーだから～、たくさん食べても大丈夫～♪", "zh": "这里的寒天很有名对吧！\n而且很健康～，多吃一点也没关系～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "d0ca6b4711c7b39aa428d2c1051ec4049c100e98164bf8acc76c54eee376ea26", "ja": "私はトマトが気になってました！\n真っ赤でおいしそうだなーって！", "zh": "我对番茄很感兴趣！红彤彤的，看起来好好吃呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1022_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "259bdad9a1ba895ffe9fd03961b85e4c192dc15e23c88d39a63b1c7b6a1256d6", "ja": "色々と調べていただいて、本当に嬉しいです！\nイベントでも是非そのあたりに触れていただけたらと！", "zh": "非常高兴您帮忙调查了这么多！如果活动中也能务必提到这方面，就太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1023_null", "source_sha256": "494fa7cf2920e00f31d70c39f224838e92e217ce28d6551ddb665731e0695eca", "ja": "イベント終了後……", "zh": "活动结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1024_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "db5aa3d654ee698df54614af88c5911d5c772b7febf28fd255591e05d68b6e98", "ja": "お二人とも、\n今日は本当にありがとうございました！", "zh": "两位，今天真的非常感谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1025_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "a231653f3da0a7ce7131f5182ec09e360f60fb9157e4edb21a77d71e3074739a", "ja": "ミニライブも特産品の紹介コーナーも大盛況で、\n何よりみなさん楽しそうで、本当によかったです！", "zh": "迷你演唱会和特产介绍环节都大受欢迎，最重要的是大家看起来都很开心，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "c2bfb57f43a4106e9d91922be912c22faee50760df8b9d7d5c9df543f1a92485", "ja": "こちらこそ、ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "我才要谢谢您——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "992321afa380d202d0d91a2a8b43d4ccbaa9d8ab16c513b4fe7a04b18eb69e17", "ja": "私もありがとうございました！　おいしいものも\nたくさん食べられて、とっても幸せでした～♪", "zh": "我也谢谢您！还吃了好多好吃的东西，真的特别幸福～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1028_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "7b6b4791b68baa877f89697af8755c4823b81b4419be7aa280cf6ec11ea0aa67", "ja": "それはなによりです！　コラボグッズやお土産、\nぜひお持ち帰りくださいね！", "zh": "那真是太好了！联动周边和伴手礼，\n请务必带回去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1029_null", "source_sha256": "9dae0e5338abd47b8aefee7f4a0ed8e3e0290cba072a205161f298ff248c9cf7", "ja": "ドサドサッ", "zh": "哗啦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "f9e56049bd99778eb7e574a68d81b0194fb581d4cf23d73d5c6e0817fe3290a3", "ja": "わーっ！　こんなにたくさん……\nいいんですか！？", "zh": "哇——！这么多……\n真的可以收下吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "5157f18b6fe406d601176a7f19d55f6c3a6ccdc8a17a8d3aff1437023ad32e11", "ja": "ようかん、プリンに、どら焼き～♪\nみんな大好き、間違いなし～♪", "zh": "羊羹、布丁，还有铜锣烧～♪\n大家肯定都喜欢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1032_madamustaff", "source_sha256": "f3f82f855c496cbc2993eadb10c69f3bf201bcfc905b8ff225e5686fe24e0604", "ja": "ほれ、お嬢ちゃんたち、\nこれも持っていき！", "zh": "喏，姑娘们，这个也拿上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1033_null", "source_sha256": "7e29d209ac77ab7073238ca126441da909634587fc27b8db187a052b47139bf5", "ja": "ドサドサドサドサッ！", "zh": "咚咚咚咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1034_005yay", "source_sha256": "dc5d9afaac8367d50e27722d7da16d19b2eebf3db2eb982d6519298cf59a2e08", "ja": "わ、椎茸の詰め合わせと、はちみつのセット！\nうっうー！　とっても嬉しいですー！！", "zh": "哇，是香菇礼盒和蜂蜜套装！\n呜呜——！我特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1035_005yay", "source_sha256": "f6928eb5055e113a5ba953ef59dc755b654c8be02fba1a27a0777740d56690ab", "ja": "はっ……！？　可奈ちゃん、私たち、\nもらってばっかりでいいのかな……？", "zh": "哈……！？可奈，我们总是收礼物，真的好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "bc2f14d35856318f27493bc5b1fc734f43b76495f1cd2a09a0a509c4f6bac4bc", "ja": "？　どうしたの、やよいちゃん？", "zh": "？怎么了，弥生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1037_005yay", "source_sha256": "68b0ae474159f90b7c6af75a4ddbbb614c760e0f042b13665fb38a24effed83e", "ja": "ほら、{$P$}とか大人の人って、\nこういう時、お返ししてるなーって……。", "zh": "你看，像{$P$}和大人们，在这种时候都会回礼的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "ad15cf7bf729dee554ad623e946f096088640b84df69e2ef467310c2e03f5fb8", "ja": "あっ、そういえば……「じつはこちらも」みたいな\n感じで、スッと紙袋出してるかも～！？", "zh": "啊，对了……说不定会像“其实我这边也有东西要给你”那样，很自然地拿出纸袋来～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1039_005yay", "source_sha256": "fb6c3b912066b3f6713c837fca6e713aa3c5344fb67b2ac77776696c56ca74d5", "ja": "うう……。でも私、お返しできるもの、\nなにも持ってなくて……。", "zh": "呜呜……可是我什么可以回赠的东西都没带……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "bb8f572325f28160af85e0a2f674dbac768342eceebb8cfd8577305638ddb527", "ja": "どうしよう、私もなにも持ってきてない……\nなのにいっぱい食べちゃった～！", "zh": "怎么办，我也什么都没带来……\n可我却吃了好多～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1041_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "a07d5c10f7dab39b06f63767659cef5d77b2af551bbf3bfcc9c05cc648cd0fae", "ja": "そんな、気にしないでください！　たくさん盛り上げて\nもらえたことへの、ほんの感謝の気持ちです。", "zh": "别放在心上！只是对大家帮忙把气氛炒得这么热烈，\n表示一点感谢的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1042_madamustaff", "source_sha256": "f10d4df768b33243e7351efddb4d3e3eedb494d105e3049d4fa130496cf2d66a", "ja": "こういうのは素直に受け取っとくの。\nほら、飴もつけたげるから、持ってってな！", "zh": "这种心意就坦率地收下吧。\n来，连糖也一起给你，拿着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1043_005yay", "source_sha256": "5dacc7c7552d67e1a84ffb330d616edc9e13669d64f8fc5dbfa564c861f8b9df", "ja": "そう、なんですか……？\nそれじゃあ………………飴も。", "zh": "这样啊……？\n那就………………糖也要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1044_madamustaff", "source_sha256": "4116b56d85c3113968fd26cbb3a7a906c1e69abb30d1c5dc75de3a7127eba662", "ja": "子どもはそんな気遣わんでええのよ。\nさ、お兄ちゃん、駅まで案内してあげて。", "zh": "小孩子不用这么客气啦。\n好啦，哥哥，带人家去车站吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1045_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "b2f4f292124cf702638c612586cb118bf51464a8a12ff9c5cca969669f626f57", "ja": "はい。あ、駅前にご案内したい定食屋さんもあるので\nよかったら、そちらにも寄りましょう。", "zh": "是的。啊，车站前还有一家定食店，我想带您去看看，\n如果您愿意的话，也去那边坐坐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1046_005yay", "source_sha256": "15c3002cd40af2431b65d48d8ab93056585906fbbbcdac4e695444f26c95d9bc", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！\n本当に、たくさんもらってばっかりで……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢你！\n真的，总是一直收你的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1047_036kan", "source_sha256": "7b1d16d370e84e15b6cdf45b69900f204481d17f1d2b3dcb60741403293ec8d5", "ja": "今度お返しに……えっと、おいしいプチシューとか、\nあと茜さんの作ったグッズとか、持ってきますから！", "zh": "下次我会带些……那个，好吃的小泡芙，还有茜小姐制作的周边来还礼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1048_kankoukyoukaistaff", "source_sha256": "ac249e053656c1eae2c0c981f6016b9fa9dd63be3c3a86b481b54531aed30f3b", "ja": "わかりました。また来てくれる機会を、\n楽しみにしています！", "zh": "明白了。期待您下次再来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1049_p", "source_sha256": "cb2b0e6932e5f168e02f58f55f95fb14e5d03e25f00cb1e9c261aaed5d16f29f", "ja": "（隠れつつ見守っていたが全く問題なかった。\nもう、二人だけで仕事をこなせるんだな……）", "zh": "（我一直躲在旁边守望，不过完全没出问题。她们已经能只靠两个人完成工作了啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "d5f7b9173548ff03cd29dc903ac3fba47eb11c5b4d7c3df3de12325437638304", "ja": "（……いや、ジーンとしてる場合じゃない！\n劇場に帰るまでが仕事だ。最後まで見守らないと！）", "zh": "（……不，现在可不是感动的时候！工作要一直做到回到剧场为止。必须守护到最后！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
